WEBVTT

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.280
Song over. The show must go.

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:16.840
So, I was making cookies,

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:17.990
<i>This may seem sudden,</i>

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:19.750
and Mom was like...

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:22.010
<i>but I really like Shigure.</i>

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:24.270
They were all ruined!

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:33.510
<i>I want to talk to her.</i>

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:44.980
<i>And I'm always imagining stuff about her.</i>

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:17.050
Rain in the Sunshine

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:22.940
Shigure! Shigure!

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:25.740
Just a second.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:27.060
Umm...

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:29.060
Food! Food!

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:30.060
Okay, okay.

00:02:19.690 --> 00:02:21.520
Hinata?

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:41.130
Whoa, really?

00:02:41.130 --> 00:02:42.680
So next Sunday...

00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.010
What about it?

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.640
I'm going to the movies.

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:52.140
Wow! You're super good, Hinata!

00:02:56.150 --> 00:02:59.150
That's seriously amazing, Hinata!

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:06.160
Come on, let me see!

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:12.250
S-Sorry!

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:14.250
S-Sorry!

00:03:26.650 --> 00:03:28.010
Shigure!

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:34.190
It's your favorite, the swan.

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:38.690
Here! Take it! There!

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:40.250
Hinata?

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:49.710
Sorry, Shigure!

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:55.130
H-Hinata?

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.710
Why'd you run from me?

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:57.750
Gulp...

00:04:00.570 --> 00:04:03.210
You like birds too...

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:06.700
So I was just thinking that maybe...

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:10.750
maybe you'd like to take care of them too?

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:12.230
Hinata!

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:14.230
Shigure!

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.230
We could do it together.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.680
Please and thank you!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:41.430
Good morning, Shigure.

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.910
Good morning, Hina—

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:45.760
Hinata! Zipper!

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.930
She's really cute.

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:52.970
Budgie
Feed

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:54.540
Yeah, and well behaved too!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:55.940
Food! Food!

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.760
Ow! No biting!

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.600
Sorry for leaving that all to you.

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.730
Don't worry about it!

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:12.950
Here!

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:16.960
Thanks. Sure is starry today.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:23.590
Galaxy soup, star bread, star croquette, star jelly, and shooting star juice!

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.720
You're amazing, Hinata!

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.730
Bring it on!

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.730
Bye bye, Shigure!

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.530
Glasses... Glasses...

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:53.490
Here are your glasses.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:55.810
Right.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.750
Careful out there, Hinata.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:39.540
Yay!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:41.540
Yahoo!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:44.270
<i>I'm the luckiest guy alive!</i>

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.570
<i>But not much later...</i>

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:17.580
<i>I saw Shigure crying all by herself.</i>

00:07:25.210 --> 00:07:28.400
Sorry, I have to hurry home today.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.570
Oh, okay. Bye bye!

00:07:30.570 --> 00:07:32.140
Bye bye, Shigure.

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:33.590
See you tomorrow!

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:48.110
Due to her father's work, Shigure will be moving away soon.

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:43.600
<i>And out of nowhere...</i>

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:46.610
<i>We heard Shigure was moving away.</i>

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:51.110
You'll come visit in the summer, right?

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:52.110
We can hang out then, right?

00:07:54.330 --> 00:07:58.120
<i>There was nothing I could do.</i>

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:13.110
Closed

00:08:20.640 --> 00:08:23.130
Let's meet up soon, Shigure!

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:23.640
Yeah.

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.670
Hinata...

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:53.210
Me and Shigure

00:09:06.010 --> 00:09:07.190
Shigure...

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:28.710
Hinata!

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.820
Shigure...

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:41.320
<i>Shigure!</i>

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.290
Whoa? Hinata?

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:13.740
<i>I have to tell her how I feel!</i>

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:23.710
Just a look into the eyes, tells us all the little things

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:30.980
Your favourite colour right now is the green after rain

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.000
Shigure!

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:42.940
A smile, pretty as a picture, envelops me like the rain

00:10:34.490 --> 00:10:42.940
A smile, pretty as a picture, envelops me like the rain

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:50.920
I forget all the pain, lulled by a gentle wind

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:53.740
What is this?

00:10:53.740 --> 00:11:00.960
Love's a mystery, proof that we're alive

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:07.890
There's nothing fancy about this, but even so

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:15.980
You make me fly, I can make you fly

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:23.380
Let's chase after the birds

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:44.180
Hiding in a shell, for fear of my life

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:46.130
couple missing shigures hereabouts

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:48.190
But those days cracked open

00:11:48.190 --> 00:11:52.190
With blinding light, the page was turned

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:50.430
Hinata!

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.150
Oh baby!

00:11:55.330 --> 00:12:02.280
Love's a mystery, set me more free

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:09.120
All the things of the past, are the past

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:17.800
Trying to dodge, but still we collide

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:12.500
Wait, Shigure!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:15.720
I... Shigure, I...

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:24.720
As we slip along this rainy path

00:12:30.840 --> 00:12:32.340
Shigure!

00:12:32.340 --> 00:12:34.020
Hinata?

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:35.520
Shigure!

00:12:45.690 --> 00:12:47.010
Shigure...

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:48.710
Shigure...

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:50.040
Shigure!

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:56.230
Shigure!

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:56.750
What is this?

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:03.880
Love's a mystery, love's so strange

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:10.680
It's nothing like the stories, but even so

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:19.780
You make me fly, I can make you fly

00:13:19.780 --> 00:13:25.490
Let's chase after the birds

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:34.620
Love's a mystery, set me more free

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:41.500
All the things of the past, are the past

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:49.930
Trying to dodge, but still we collide

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:46.680
Shigure!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.530
Shigure!

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:58.020
As we slip along this rainy path

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.140
Hinata!

00:13:53.820 --> 00:13:59.250
Over here, Shigure!

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:39.020
Shigure!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.770
Shigure!

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:44.110
Hinata!

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:52.180
Shigure...

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:56.080
Here.

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:57.560
From me to Shigure

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:31.340
Shigure...

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:35.920
I, uh... Shigure, I...

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:37.080
Uh...

00:15:38.720 --> 00:15:40.080
Shigure...

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:42.930
Good luck.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:49.480
Thank you.

00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:16.230
We went to live at my father's old home.

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:20.720
At first everything was new and difficult,

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:24.180
but now, every day is loads of fun.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:30.190
Still, maybe one day...

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:32.200
I'll go back.

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.860
I often wonder how Hinata is doing.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:45.460
What a lovely, clumsy little boy.
